{"surah":91,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"91:1","arabic":"وَٱلشَّمۡسِ وَضُحَىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"By the sun and its brightness","id":"Demi matahari dan sinarnya pada pagi hari,","words":[{"a":"وَٱلشَّمۡسِ","en":"By the sun","id":"By the sun"},{"a":"وَضُحَىٰهَا","en":"and its brightness","id":"and its brightness"}]},{"n":2,"key":"91:2","arabic":"وَٱلۡقَمَرِ إِذَا تَلَىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] the moon when it follows it","id":"demi bulan apabila mengiringinya,","words":[{"a":"وَٱلۡقَمَرِ","en":"And the moon","id":"And the moon"},{"a":"إِذَا","en":"when","id":"when"},{"a":"تَلَىٰهَا","en":"it follows it","id":"it follows it"}]},{"n":3,"key":"91:3","arabic":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا جَلَّىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] the day when it displays it","id":"demi siang apabila menampakkannya,","words":[{"a":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ","en":"And the day","id":"And the day"},{"a":"إِذَا","en":"when","id":"when"},{"a":"جَلَّىٰهَا","en":"it displays it","id":"it displays it"}]},{"n":4,"key":"91:4","arabic":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا يَغۡشَىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] the night when it covers [i.e., conceals] it","id":"demi malam apabila menutupinya (gelap gulita),","words":[{"a":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ","en":"And the night","id":"And the night"},{"a":"إِذَا","en":"when","id":"when"},{"a":"يَغۡشَىٰهَا","en":"it covers it","id":"it covers it"}]},{"n":5,"key":"91:5","arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَمَا بَنَىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] the sky and He who constructed it","id":"demi langit serta perancangannya (yang menakjubkan),","words":[{"a":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","en":"And the heaven","id":"And the heaven"},{"a":"وَمَا","en":"and (He) Who","id":"and (He) Who"},{"a":"بَنَىٰهَا","en":"constructed it","id":"constructed it"}]},{"n":6,"key":"91:6","arabic":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَمَا طَحَىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] the earth and He who spread it","id":"demi bumi serta penghamparannya,","words":[{"a":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ","en":"And the earth","id":"And the earth"},{"a":"وَمَا","en":"and by (He) Who","id":"and by (He) Who"},{"a":"طَحَىٰهَا","en":"spread it","id":"spread it"}]},{"n":7,"key":"91:7","arabic":"وَنَفۡسٖ وَمَا سَوَّىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] the soul and He who proportioned it","id":"demi jiwa serta penyempurnaan (ciptaan)nya,","words":[{"a":"وَنَفۡسٖ","en":"And (the) soul","id":"And (the) soul"},{"a":"وَمَا","en":"and (He) Who","id":"and (He) Who"},{"a":"سَوَّىٰهَا","en":"proportioned it","id":"proportioned it"}]},{"n":8,"key":"91:8","arabic":"فَأَلۡهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَقۡوَىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness,","id":"maka Dia mengilhamkan kepadanya (jalan) kejahatan dan ketakwaannya,","words":[{"a":"فَأَلۡهَمَهَا","en":"And He inspired it","id":"And He inspired it"},{"a":"فُجُورَهَا","en":"(to distinguish) its wickedness","id":"(to distinguish) its wickedness"},{"a":"وَتَقۡوَىٰهَا","en":"and its righteousness","id":"and its righteousness"}]},{"n":9,"key":"91:9","arabic":"قَدۡ أَفۡلَحَ مَن زَكَّىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"He has succeeded who purifies it,","id":"sungguh beruntung orang yang menyucikannya (jiwa itu),","words":[{"a":"قَدۡ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed"},{"a":"أَفۡلَحَ","en":"he succeeds","id":"he succeeds"},{"a":"مَن","en":"who","id":"who"},{"a":"زَكَّىٰهَا","en":"purifies it","id":"purifies it"}]},{"n":10,"key":"91:10","arabic":"وَقَدۡ خَابَ مَن دَسَّىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And he has failed who instills it [with corruption].","id":"dan sungguh rugi orang yang mengotorinya.","words":[{"a":"وَقَدۡ","en":"And indeed","id":"And indeed"},{"a":"خَابَ","en":"he fails","id":"he fails"},{"a":"مَن","en":"who","id":"who"},{"a":"دَسَّىٰهَا","en":"buries it","id":"buries it"}]},{"n":11,"key":"91:11","arabic":"كَذَّبَتۡ ثَمُودُ بِطَغۡوَىٰهَآ","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"Thamūd denied [their prophet] by reason of their transgression,","id":"(Kaum) Samud telah mendustakan (rasulnya) karena mereka melampaui batas (zalim),","words":[{"a":"كَذَّبَتۡ","en":"Denied","id":"Denied"},{"a":"ثَمُودُ","en":"Thamud","id":"Thamud"},{"a":"بِطَغۡوَىٰهَآ","en":"by their transgression","id":"by their transgression"}]},{"n":12,"key":"91:12","arabic":"إِذِ ٱنۢبَعَثَ أَشۡقَىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth.","id":"ketika bangkit orang yang paling celaka di antara mereka,","words":[{"a":"إِذِ","en":"When","id":"When"},{"a":"ٱنۢبَعَثَ","en":"(was) sent forth","id":"(was) sent forth"},{"a":"أَشۡقَىٰهَا","en":"(the) most wicked of them","id":"(the) most wicked of them"}]},{"n":13,"key":"91:13","arabic":"فَقَالَ لَهُمۡ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ نَاقَةَ ٱللَّهِ وَسُقۡيَٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And the messenger of Allāh [i.e., Ṣāliḥ] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allāh or [prevent her from] her drink.\"","id":"lalu Rasul Allah (Saleh) berkata kepada mereka, \"(Biarkanlah) unta betina dari Allah ini dengan minumannya.\"","words":[{"a":"فَقَالَ","en":"But said","id":"But said"},{"a":"لَهُمۡ","en":"to them","id":"to them"},{"a":"رَسُولُ","en":"(the) Messenger","id":"(the) Messenger"},{"a":"ٱللَّهِ","en":"(of) Allah","id":"(of) Allah"},{"a":"نَاقَةَ","en":"(It is the) she-camel","id":"(It is the) she-camel"},{"a":"ٱللَّهِ","en":"(of) Allah","id":"(of) Allah"},{"a":"وَسُقۡيَٰهَا","en":"and her drink","id":"and her drink"}]},{"n":14,"key":"91:14","arabic":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمۡدَمَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ رَبُّهُم بِذَنۢبِهِمۡ فَسَوَّىٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them].","id":"Namun mereka mendustakannya dan menyembelihnya, karena itu Tuhan membinasakan mereka karena dosanya, lalu diratakan-Nya (dengan tanah).","words":[{"a":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ","en":"But they denied him","id":"But they denied him"},{"a":"فَعَقَرُوهَا","en":"and they hamstrung her","id":"and they hamstrung her"},{"a":"فَدَمۡدَمَ","en":"So destroyed","id":"So destroyed"},{"a":"عَلَيۡهِمۡ","en":"them","id":"them"},{"a":"رَبُّهُم","en":"their Lord","id":"their Lord"},{"a":"بِذَنۢبِهِمۡ","en":"for their sin","id":"for their sin"},{"a":"فَسَوَّىٰهَا","en":"and leveled them","id":"and leveled them"}]},{"n":15,"key":"91:15","arabic":"وَلَا يَخَافُ عُقۡبَٰهَا","page":595,"juz":30,"en":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof.","id":"Dan Dia tidak takut terhadap akibatnya.","words":[{"a":"وَلَا","en":"And not","id":"And not"},{"a":"يَخَافُ","en":"He fears","id":"He fears"},{"a":"عُقۡبَٰهَا","en":"its consequences","id":"its consequences"}]}]}